        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/51be38901e9864d33e324c21adfc1810.avif?t=1782095294\" width=1200 height=75 /></span>Explore side-scrolling levels filled with environmental puzzles. Purr to make plants bloom and machines crumble. Take your time. Experiment. Observe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when a boss appears, the rhythm changes. These battles demand timing, precision, and courage. Yet Princess doesn't fight. She heals. Purr doesn't destroy them – it frees them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/8e81ece22781feebad76b2d64a552b88.poster.avif?t=1782095294\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/8e81ece22781feebad76b2d64a552b88.webm?t=1782095294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/8e81ece22781feebad76b2d64a552b88.mp4?t=1782095294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/39058d1a8317cfbc0f2a315f9d755f2b.avif?t=1782095294\" width=1200 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every environment and character is meticulously hand-painted and brought to life with fluid animation – lush forests, glowing caverns, strange machines, and adorable creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/ec9ca68d0c7222c331e6ca9b9c7f96a1.poster.avif?t=1782095294\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/ec9ca68d0c7222c331e6ca9b9c7f96a1.webm?t=1782095294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/ec9ca68d0c7222c331e6ca9b9c7f96a1.mp4?t=1782095294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/f9fc1c084a728ecad8d082d990f14fdf.avif?t=1782095294\" width=1200 height=75 /></span>From moonlit forests to the depths of a hidden laboratory, each chapter holds new puzzles, new friends, and new questions. Why did the camel attack? Why does the spider never rest? The answers lie in the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/6be5e8e45a7e150ea2d2e5eafcadf7b9.poster.avif?t=1782095294\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/6be5e8e45a7e150ea2d2e5eafcadf7b9.webm?t=1782095294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/6be5e8e45a7e150ea2d2e5eafcadf7b9.mp4?t=1782095294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/829da3e1914f569f1238477d7ceeb179.avif?t=1782095294\" width=1200 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Choose Kitten Mode for an easier adventure perfect for kids and casual players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Choose Cat Mode to test yourself, where boss encounters demand precision and patience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/9a16395061fe940f85633bfd68c0e497.poster.avif?t=1782095294\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/9a16395061fe940f85633bfd68c0e497.webm?t=1782095294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/9a16395061fe940f85633bfd68c0e497.mp4?t=1782095294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/a8e8c89800863f7b5d312012b9ae6efc.avif?t=1782095294\" width=1200 height=75 /></span>No text. No dialogue. Only animation, music, and heartfelt emotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original orchestral score, partially live-recorded, guides your journey with warmth and wonder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/3253c81703f7b46c28515682b3ea1d11.poster.avif?t=1782095294\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/3253c81703f7b46c28515682b3ea1d11.webm?t=1782095294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/3253c81703f7b46c28515682b3ea1d11.mp4?t=1782095294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/22d4674a64d3bfd5606f71b1d624bd88.avif?t=1782095294\" width=1200 height=75 /></span>Deep in a forgotten laboratory, life was reshaped against its will – animals twisted into machines, hearts buried under circuits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But corruption is not the end. What was taken from nature can still be returned. Let Princess's purr heal them and set them free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/788df3d4b8e4d0496eaf8bb18ac7ca3d.poster.avif?t=1782095294\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/788df3d4b8e4d0496eaf8bb18ac7ca3d.webm?t=1782095294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/788df3d4b8e4d0496eaf8bb18ac7ca3d.mp4?t=1782095294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
